{"id":"n90727-1-8","stage":4,"title":"식민지 · 殖民地","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90727-1-8-1","ko":"이 나라 사람들은 왜 영어를 쓰는 거죠?","zh":"这个国家的人为什么使用英语呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"나라","meaning":"国，国家","explanation":"나라：国，国家。","readings":[{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29699","senseId":"1","lemma":"나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들은","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람들은","audio":"/audio/f7f40c6478ace61ef47f.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"영어를","meaning":"英语","explanation":"영어：英语；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"영어","audio":"/audio/9a37f8fdb58ccaa0bb5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28241","senseId":"1","lemma":"영어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영어를","audio":"/audio/0342b57b259bd942d877.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰는","meaning":"用，说","explanation":"쓰다：用，说；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"10","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfa